  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've been working in vrchat a lot recently with hand tracking, and I've noticed a couple of pain points relating to gesture locking:\n\n- i feel like the hand lock button takes too long to activate. when you work in vrc with keyboard, you frequently toggle hand lock to check your online friends and stuff\n\n- when hand lock is activated:\n\n    - you can interact with your radial menu, but can't interact with the close button in the center.\n\n    - you have a laser pointer on your quick menu, but can't interact with it. this is confusing. you should remove the quick menu laser pointer or show an indicator icon to communicate this. i actually restarted vrchat twice because i thought i broke it until i understood.",
